<BaseLayout title="Your signal & privacy — Boomley"><main class="wrap section" style="max-width:850px"><a class="quiet-link" href="/">← Back to Boomley</a><h1 style="font-size:clamp(42px,7vw,70px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:45px 0">Your signal.<br/><em>Handled with care.</em></h1><div style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#bfc2ca"><p>When you send a signal, Boomley receives the subject, message, name if supplied, and reply email. We use these details to consider your idea and contact you about it.</p><p style="margin-top:25px">If you join the 0001 list, we use your email for updates about that product. You can ask to leave the list at any time.</p><p style="margin-top:25px">Forms are processed and stored by Netlify, our website hosting provider. Please avoid including sensitive personal information or confidential material in your message.</p><p style="margin-top:25px">For questions about your information, or to request removal of your submission or email from our list, contact <a class="quiet-link" href="mailto:hello@boomley.com">hello@boomley.com ↗</a>.</p><p style="margin-top:25px">The opening story uses your browser’s session storage to avoid repeating during the same browsing session.</p></div></main></BaseLayout>
